Cell["\<\
Notice how the broad dispersive star-shaped wings of the diagonal peaks \
extend far across the spectrum when phased for pure absorption cross peaks \
(left). In crowded spectra, those dispersive diagonal tails easily obscure \
nearby cross peaks. Double-Quantum Filtered COSY (DQF-COSY) solves this by \
placing both diagonal and cross peaks on equal anti-phase footing.\
\>", "Text",ExpressionUUID->"d550c4e5-570f-474b-b298-f3ff2c5a8a41"]
}, Open  ]],

Cell[CellGroupData[{

Cell["2. DQF-COSY with CoherenceOrderFiltration", "Section",ExpressionUUID->"3dd269cb-a46e-b24f-9831-89129a85c7ce"],

Cell["\<\
DQF-COSY replaces the single mixing pulse with two adjacent 90-degree pulses \
separated by a double-quantum filter:
  90_x  -  t1  -  90_x  -  [DQF: select p in {-2, +2}]  -  90_x  -  t2

Between the second and third pulses, only double-quantum coherences (p = \
+/-2) are allowed to survive:
  1. Any in-phase single-quantum term remaining at the end of t1 is converted \
by the second 90_x pulse into longitudinal magnetization (p = 0) or \
single-quantum coherence (p = +/-1), so it is rejected by the filter.
  2. Only anti-phase single-quantum terms (2 I_1z I_2x,y, created by sin(Pi J \
t1) evolution) are rotated into two-spin double-quantum coherence (2 I_1x \
I_2y +/- 2 I_1y I_2x), pass through the filter, and are converted back into \
anti-phase single-quantum coherence by the third 90_x read pulse.

In SpinDynamica, we can place CoherenceOrderFiltration[{-2, 2}] directly \
inside the Mixing list. Notice from ReportSignalCalculationMethod -> True \
that coherence-order filtration inside Signal2D runs directly in fast Hilbert \
space.\
\>", "Text",ExpressionUUID->"b6626c0b-09cc-3549-8709-356aca10c817"],

Cell[CellGroupData[{

Cell[BoxData[{
 RowBox[{
  RowBox[{"dqfMix", "=", 
   RowBox[{"{", 
    RowBox[{
     RowBox[{"Pulse", "[", 
      RowBox[{"{", 
       RowBox[{
        RowBox[{"Pi", "/", "2"}], ",", "\"\<x\>\""}], "}"}], "]"}], ",", 
     RowBox[{"CoherenceOrderFiltration", "[", 
      RowBox[{"{", 
       RowBox[{
        RowBox[{"-", "2"}], ",", "2"}], "}"}], "]"}], ",", 
     RowBox[{"Pulse", "[", 
      RowBox[{"{", 
       RowBox[{
        RowBox[{"Pi", "/", "2"}], ",", "\"\<x\>\""}], "}"}], "]"}]}], "}"}]}],
   ";"}], "\n", 
 RowBox[{
  RowBox[{"sigDQF", "=", 
   RowBox[{"Signal2D", "[", 
    RowBox[{
     RowBox[{"{", 
      RowBox[{
       RowBox[{"{", 
        RowBox[{"{", 
         RowBox[{
          RowBox[{"2", "Pi", "800."}], ",", "64"}], "}"}], "}"}], ",", 
       RowBox[{"{", 
        RowBox[{"{", 
         RowBox[{
          RowBox[{"2", "Pi", "800."}], ",", "128"}], "}"}], "}"}]}], "}"}], ",", 
     RowBox[{"InitialDensityOperator", "->", "rho0"}], ",", 
     RowBox[{"Preparation", "->", 
      RowBox[{"Pulse", "[", 
       RowBox[{"{", 
        RowBox[{
         RowBox[{"Pi", "/", "2"}], ",", "\"\<x\>\""}], "}"}], "]"}]}], ",", 
     RowBox[{"Mixing", "->", "dqfMix"}], ",", 
     RowBox[{"BackgroundGenerator", "->", "Hax"}], ",", 
     RowBox[{"LineBroadening", "->", "16."}], ",", 
     RowBox[{"ReportSignalCalculationMethod", "->", "True"}]}], "]"}]}], 
  ";"}], "\n", 
 RowBox[{
  RowBox[{"specDQF", "=", 
   RowBox[{"FT", "[", 
    RowBox[{"sigDQF", ",", 
     RowBox[{"ZeroFill", "->", 
      RowBox[{"{", 
       RowBox[{"2", ",", "2"}], "}"}]}], ",", 
     RowBox[{"PhaseCorrection", "->", 
      RowBox[{"{", 
       RowBox[{
        RowBox[{"Pi", "/", "2"}], ",", 
        RowBox[{"Pi", "/", "2"}]}], "}"}]}]}], "]"}]}], ";"}], "\n", 
 RowBox[{"GraphicsRow", "[", 
  RowBox[{
   RowBox[{"{", 
    RowBox[{
     RowBox[{"PlotSpectrum2D", "[", 
      RowBox[{"specCosyCross", ",", 
       RowBox[{"PlotRange", "->", 
        RowBox[{"{", 
         RowBox[{
          RowBox[{"{", 
           RowBox[{
            RowBox[{"-", "280"}], ",", "280"}], "}"}], ",", 
          RowBox[{"{", 
           RowBox[{
            RowBox[{"-", "280"}], ",", "280"}], "}"}]}], "}"}]}], ",", 
       RowBox[{"BaseContourLevel", "->", "0.04"}], ",", 
       RowBox[{"PlotLabel", "->", "\"\<COSY-90 (RR, Phase {0, 0})\>\""}], ",", 
       RowBox[{"ImageSize", "->", "320"}]}], "]"}], ",", 
     RowBox[{"PlotSpectrum2D", "[", 
      RowBox[{"specDQF", ",", 
       RowBox[{"PlotRange", "->", 
        RowBox[{"{", 
         RowBox[{
          RowBox[{"{", 
           RowBox[{
            RowBox[{"-", "280"}], ",", "280"}], "}"}], ",", 
          RowBox[{"{", 
           RowBox[{
            RowBox[{"-", "280"}], ",", "280"}], "}"}]}], "}"}]}], ",", 
       RowBox[{"BaseContourLevel", "->", "0.04"}], ",", 
       RowBox[{
       "PlotLabel", "->", "\"\<DQF-COSY (RR, Phase {Pi/2, Pi/2})\>\""}], ",", 
       RowBox[{"ImageSize", "->", "320"}]}], "]"}]}], "}"}], ",", 
   RowBox[{"ImageSize", "->", "700"}], ",", 
   RowBox[{"Spacings", "->", "16"}]}], "]"}]}], "Input",
 CellLabel->"In[15]:=",ExpressionUUID->"6726a6b2-69d5-a643-800c-5ccedd997ef8"],

