Cell["\<\
In the left slice (F1 = -108 Hz), the COSY-90 diagonal at F2 = -120 Hz has \
broad asymmetric dispersive wings, while the DQF-COSY diagonal collapses into \
a crisp anti-phase absorption doublet that returns cleanly to baseline \
\[AHat]\.80\.94 at the same vertical position as the cross peak on the right \
(F2 = +180 Hz).\
\>", "Text",ExpressionUUID->"0d112b59-a54c-6948-8f32-f9745e69f795"]
}, Open  ]],

Cell[CellGroupData[{

Cell["3. Implementing the Double-Quantum Filter via PhaseCycle", "Section",ExpressionUUID->"fbd09df2-e364-7449-8b41-f94418520734"],

Cell["\<\
On a real spectrometer there is no instantaneous projector like \
CoherenceOrderFiltration[{-2, 2}]. Instead, double-quantum selection is \
achieved either with pulsed field gradients or by co-adding transients in a \
4-step PhaseCycle.

Below we demonstrate both classic 4-step phase cycles using Signal2D's \
PhaseCycle option:
  1. Read-pulse cycle (pcRead): hold the first two 90_x pulses fixed and \
cycle the final 90-degree read pulse phase phi_3 = k Pi/2 (x, y, -x, -y) \
while shifting the receiver phase by -k Pi/2 (because coherence changes by \
Delta_p = -1 - (+/-2) = {-3, +1}, both of which satisfy Exp[-I * Delta_p * \
phi_3] = Exp[-I * k Pi/2], and Signal2D applies Exp[-I * ReceiverPhase]).
  2. Excitation-pulse cycle (pcPrepMix): cycle BOTH the preparation pulse and \
the second conversion pulse together by k Pi/2 (so double-quantum coherence \
acquires phase +/-2 * k Pi/2 = k Pi) while alternating the receiver phase by \
k Pi (0, Pi, 0, Pi).\
\>", "Text",ExpressionUUID->"f32c1c97-3710-6241-a844-a852f4b1ac14"],

Cell[CellGroupData[{

Cell[BoxData[{
 RowBox[{
  RowBox[{"pcRead", "=", 
   RowBox[{"Table", "[", 
    RowBox[{
     RowBox[{"<|", 
      RowBox[{
       RowBox[{"\"\<Mixing\>\"", "->", 
        RowBox[{"{", 
         RowBox[{
          RowBox[{"Pulse", "[", 
           RowBox[{"{", 
            RowBox[{
             RowBox[{"Pi", "/", "2"}], ",", "\"\<x\>\""}], "}"}], "]"}], ",", 
          RowBox[{"Pulse", "[", 
           RowBox[{"{", 
            RowBox[{
             RowBox[{"Pi", "/", "2"}], ",", 
             RowBox[{"k", "*", 
              RowBox[{"Pi", "/", "2"}]}]}], "}"}], "]"}]}], "}"}]}], ",", 
       RowBox[{"\"\<ReceiverPhase\>\"", "->", 
        RowBox[{
         RowBox[{"-", "k"}], "*", 
         RowBox[{"Pi", "/", "2"}]}]}]}], "|>"}], ",", 
     RowBox[{"{", 
      RowBox[{"k", ",", "0", ",", "3"}], "}"}]}], "]"}]}], ";"}], "\n", 
 RowBox[{
  RowBox[{"pcPrepMix", "=", 
   RowBox[{"Table", "[", 
    RowBox[{
     RowBox[{"<|", 
      RowBox[{
       RowBox[{"\"\<Preparation\>\"", "->", 
        RowBox[{"Pulse", "[", 
         RowBox[{"{", 
          RowBox[{
           RowBox[{"Pi", "/", "2"}], ",", 
           RowBox[{"k", "*", 
            RowBox[{"Pi", "/", "2"}]}]}], "}"}], "]"}]}], ",", 
       RowBox[{"\"\<Mixing\>\"", "->", 
        RowBox[{"{", 
         RowBox[{
          RowBox[{"Pulse", "[", 
           RowBox[{"{", 
            RowBox[{
             RowBox[{"Pi", "/", "2"}], ",", 
             RowBox[{"k", "*", 
              RowBox[{"Pi", "/", "2"}]}]}], "}"}], "]"}], ",", 
          RowBox[{"Pulse", "[", 
           RowBox[{"{", 
            RowBox[{
             RowBox[{"Pi", "/", "2"}], ",", "\"\<x\>\""}], "}"}], "]"}]}], 
         "}"}]}], ",", 
       RowBox[{"\"\<ReceiverPhase\>\"", "->", 
        RowBox[{"k", "*", "Pi"}]}]}], "|>"}], ",", 
     RowBox[{"{", 
      RowBox[{"k", ",", "0", ",", "3"}], "}"}]}], "]"}]}], ";"}], "\n", 
 RowBox[{
  RowBox[{"sigDQFRead", "=", 
   RowBox[{"Signal2D", "[", 
    RowBox[{
     RowBox[{"{", 
      RowBox[{
       RowBox[{"{", 
        RowBox[{"{", 
         RowBox[{
          RowBox[{"2", "Pi", "800."}], ",", "64"}], "}"}], "}"}], ",", 
       RowBox[{"{", 
        RowBox[{"{", 
         RowBox[{
          RowBox[{"2", "Pi", "800."}], ",", "128"}], "}"}], "}"}]}], "}"}], ",", 
     RowBox[{"InitialDensityOperator", "->", "rho0"}], ",", 
     RowBox[{"Preparation", "->", 
      RowBox[{"Pulse", "[", 
       RowBox[{"{", 
        RowBox[{
         RowBox[{"Pi", "/", "2"}], ",", "\"\<x\>\""}], "}"}], "]"}]}], ",", 
     RowBox[{"BackgroundGenerator", "->", "Hax"}], ",", 
     RowBox[{"PhaseCycle", "->", "pcRead"}], ",", 
     RowBox[{"LineBroadening", "->", "16."}]}], "]"}]}], ";"}], "\n", 
 RowBox[{
  RowBox[{"sigDQFPrepMix", "=", 
   RowBox[{"Signal2D", "[", 
    RowBox[{
     RowBox[{"{", 
      RowBox[{
       RowBox[{"{", 
        RowBox[{"{", 
         RowBox[{
          RowBox[{"2", "Pi", "800."}], ",", "64"}], "}"}], "}"}], ",", 
       RowBox[{"{", 
        RowBox[{"{", 
         RowBox[{
          RowBox[{"2", "Pi", "800."}], ",", "128"}], "}"}], "}"}]}], "}"}], ",", 
     RowBox[{"InitialDensityOperator", "->", "rho0"}], ",", 
     RowBox[{"BackgroundGenerator", "->", "Hax"}], ",", 
     RowBox[{"PhaseCycle", "->", "pcPrepMix"}], ",", 
     RowBox[{"LineBroadening", "->", "16."}]}], "]"}]}], ";"}], "\n", 
 RowBox[{"Dataset", "[", 
  RowBox[{"{", 
   RowBox[{
    RowBox[{"<|", 
     RowBox[{
      RowBox[{"\"\<Implementation\>\"", 
       "->", "\"\<4-step Read-Pulse Cycle\>\""}], ",", 
      RowBox[{"\"\<Max |Cos - Ideal|\>\"", "->", 
       RowBox[{"Max", "[", 
        RowBox[{"Abs", "[", 
         RowBox[{
          RowBox[{"sigDQFRead", "[", "\"\<Cos\>\"", "]"}], "-", 
          RowBox[{"sigDQF", "[", "\"\<Cos\>\"", "]"}]}], "]"}], "]"}]}], ",", 
      RowBox[{"\"\<Max |Sin - Ideal|\>\"", "->", 
       RowBox[{"Max", "[", 
        RowBox[{"Abs", "[", 
         RowBox[{
          RowBox[{"sigDQFRead", "[", "\"\<Sin\>\"", "]"}], "-", 
          RowBox[{"sigDQF", "[", "\"\<Sin\>\"", "]"}]}], "]"}], "]"}]}]}], 
     "|>"}], ",", 
    RowBox[{"<|", 
     RowBox[{
      RowBox[{"\"\<Implementation\>\"", 
       "->", "\"\<4-step Prep+Conversion Cycle\>\""}], ",", 
      RowBox[{"\"\<Max |Cos - Ideal|\>\"", "->", 
       RowBox[{"Max", "[", 
        RowBox[{"Abs", "[", 
         RowBox[{
          RowBox[{"sigDQFPrepMix", "[", "\"\<Cos\>\"", "]"}], "-", 
          RowBox[{"sigDQF", "[", "\"\<Cos\>\"", "]"}]}], "]"}], "]"}]}], ",", 
      RowBox[{"\"\<Max |Sin - Ideal|\>\"", "->", 
       RowBox[{"Max", "[", 
        RowBox[{"Abs", "[", 
         RowBox[{
          RowBox[{"sigDQFPrepMix", "[", "\"\<Sin\>\"", "]"}], "-", 
          RowBox[{"sigDQF", "[", "\"\<Sin\>\"", "]"}]}], "]"}], "]"}]}]}], 
     "|>"}]}], "}"}], "]"}]}], "Input",
 CellLabel->"In[24]:=",ExpressionUUID->"eab2891f-a514-5242-943e-d8db39f5c467"],

